translation.apps.template.review-queue.name	Review queue
translation.apps.template.review-queue.description	Review eval runs or label examples as a team, then export the results
translation.apps.template.review-queue.placeholder	Build a review queue where teammates go through eval runs or examples one at a time, label each one, leave comments and export the results. Start from a sample run file, then ask me for our real data and swap it in.
translation.apps.template.project-status.name	Project status page
translation.apps.template.project-status.description	A project's progress, owners and blockers from Linear, Jira or GitHub
translation.apps.template.project-status.placeholder	Build a status page for a project from its issues in Linear, Jira or GitHub. Ask me which tracker and project to use before building. Show progress, owners, blockers and recent changes, and refresh the data on a schedule.
translation.apps.template.metrics-dashboard.name	Metrics dashboard
translation.apps.template.metrics-dashboard.description	Charts of your own metrics from a data warehouse or API
translation.apps.template.metrics-dashboard.placeholder	Build a dashboard of our key metrics from a data warehouse or API. Ask me which source and metrics to use before building. Chart trends over time with date filters, and refresh the data on a schedule.
translation.apps.template.incident-dashboard.name	Incident dashboard
translation.apps.template.incident-dashboard.description	Deploys, error rates and open incidents in one live view
translation.apps.template.incident-dashboard.placeholder	Build a live dashboard of recent deploys, error rates and open incidents. Show severity, owner and a timeline of updates for each incident.
translation.apps.template.customer-health.name	Customer health explorer
translation.apps.template.customer-health.description	Search any account to see usage, plan and open tickets
translation.apps.template.customer-health.placeholder	Build a searchable account explorer showing each customer's plan, recent usage and open support tickets. Add filters to find accounts that need attention.
translation.apps.template.design-system.name	Design system
translation.apps.template.design-system.description	A living gallery of components, tokens and copyable code from your repo
translation.apps.template.design-system.placeholder	Build a gallery from the components and tokens in this repository. Show component variants, color and typography tokens and copyable usage examples.
